type: software
title: "TrackerlessBronchoscopicNavigation"
abstract: >-
  3D Slicer modules for vision-based (trackerless) navigated bronchoscopy:
  recording and replaying bronchoscope video, generating depth maps from
  bronchoscopic images, self-supervised camera pose estimation, centerline
  computation, and trajectory analysis.
